WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.751
One night your dad called, and you talked for an hour about nothing. You said you should call him more.

2
00:00:08.051 --> 00:00:13.036
A few months later, you find that entry again. Tap Reply.

3
00:00:14.336 --> 00:00:18.298
It plays big, and you talk back while it plays.

4
00:00:18.998 --> 00:00:22.934
[Your reply] I did call him. We've talked every Sunday since.

5
00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:28.255
Pause it, or slide back to a moment. It keeps recording you.

6
00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:34.069
Your reply is saved as its own entry, linked to the old one, months later.

7
00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:38.616
Any entry can get a reply. Look for Reply.
